<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-DUFAUX WINS 19TH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-DUFAUX WINS 19TH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</headline>
<dateline>AVILA, Spain 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Laurent Dufaux of Switzerland won the 19th stage of the Tour of Spain over 212 kms between Getafe and Avila on Thursday.</p>
<p>Alex Zuelle of Switzerland retained the overall leader's yellow jersey.</p>
</text>
